# MakiSwap Smart Contract Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for MakiSwap.

MakiSwap is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a DeFi and swap protocol smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: MakiSwap  
Audit type: DeFi and swap protocol smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

